00:35:13,326 --> 00:35:22,404
一旦我们部署到一定程度，就会不断遇到这个问题。当达到约 60% 的分发量时，我们的服务器就会出现这种情况，客户端无法渲染。
We were constantly hitting this once we rolled out far enough. We'd hit about 60% rollout, and then this would start being seen in our servers, and clients weren't rendering.

424
00:35:22,830 --> 00:35:24,592
我们对此有很多推测。
We had a lot of theories about this.

425
00:35:24,942 --> 00:35:30,564
我坚持要求完全关闭服务端渲染，因为我觉得我们并不从中受益，而且这事儿非常可怕。
I insisted that we turn off server rendering entirely because I didn't think we benefited from it, and this was terrifying.

426
00:35:31,054 --> 00:35:38,500
显然，很多在 Vercel 上将大型应用迁移到 Tanstack Start 的人也遇到过类似的问题。Gabriel 说他们在处理 Axiom 时也经常遇到这个问题。
Apparently, a lot of people who have ported big apps over to Tanstack Start on Vercel have run into things like this. Gabriel said they've had the issue quite a bit for Axiom as well.

427
00:35:38,752 --> 00:35:42,596
情况非常糟糕，我们的部署一达到约 60% 的分发量就会崩溃。
