路由、API 上传路由、API stripe、status、server version、checkout sync、chat，所有的 API 路由都从 TanStack 中完全移除。
Routes, API uploading routes, API stripe, status, server version, checkout sync, chat, all of our API routes were removed from TanStack entirely.

470
00:40:06,158 --> 00:40:12,496
然后在这里的 VT 配置中，我们实际上在配置 Nitro，现在我们传递一个 server dir。
And then here in the VT config where we actually configure Nitro, we pass a server dir now.

